# game/case02.rpy:54
translate japanese press_marisa_1_d5539b38:

    # you "And when exactly do you plan to die?"
    you "で、いつ死ぬ予定なんだ？"

# game/case02.rpy:56
translate japanese press_marisa_1_56da0f24:

    # marisa "Not anytime soon. That's the beauty of it."
    marisa "当分は死なないぜ。そこがミソだ。"

# game/case02.rpy:58
translate japanese press_marisa_1_0e07f9f7:

    # eiki "A loan with no due date. I will be writing to the Ministry."
    eiki "返却期限のない貸し出し。是非曲直庁に報告書を書きます。"

# game/case02.rpy:62
translate japanese press_marisa_2_6617e5bf:

    # you "You inspected the dust personally?"
    you "埃を自分で確かめたのか？"

# game/case02.rpy:63
translate japanese press_marisa_2_bd6b9539:

    # marisa "Wiped it off with my sleeve. Didn't want to steal the dust. That'd be wrong."
    marisa "袖で拭いたぜ。埃まで盗むわけにはいかないからな。それは悪いことだ。"

# game/case02.rpy:67
translate japanese press_marisa_3_e6cb0fc7:

    # you "Not the only one? Who else?"
    you "自分だけじゃない？他に誰が？"

# game/case02.rpy:68
translate japanese press_marisa_3_4909bacb:

    # marisa "Oh, nobody. Just a certain shrine maiden. With a certain donation box."
    marisa "いや、誰でもないさ。ある巫女さんがね。ある賽銭箱とね。"

# game/case02.rpy:69
translate japanese press_marisa_3_dc808abb:

    # marisa "You know what? Put it in the testimony."
    marisa "そうだ、それも証言に入れといてくれ。"

# game/case02.rpy:73
translate japanese press_marisa_4_7ea46083:

    # you "What does Reimu's donation box have to do with your books?"
    you "霊夢の賽銭箱が、お前の本と何の関係がある？"

# game/case02.rpy:75
translate japanese press_marisa_4_0f2d6002:

    # marisa "Everything! If the shrine maiden does it, it can't be that bad, right?"
    marisa "大ありだ！巫女がやってるなら、そう悪いことじゃないだろ？"

# game/case02.rpy:77
translate japanese press_marisa_4_64eeb60c:

    # eiki "Reimu's ledger is Reimu's problem. Yours is forty-seven books long."
    eiki "霊夢の帳簿は霊夢の問題です。あなたの問題は四十七冊分あります。"

# game/case02.rpy:88
translate japanese case2_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "静粛に。彼岸論理法廷を開廷します。"

# game/case02.rpy:90
translate japanese case2_b506956e:

    # eiki "Komachi. The defendant?"
    eiki "小町。被告人は？"

# game/case02.rpy:91
translate japanese case2_fbd7043b:

    # komachi "Came in through the window, boss."
    komachi "窓から入ってきましたよ、四季様。"

# game/case02.rpy:92
translate japanese case2_5aa8c5a9:

    # eiki "We have a door."
    eiki "扉があるでしょう。"

# game/case02.rpy:93
translate japanese case2_6f355403:

    # komachi "I mentioned that. She said doors are for people with time to spare."
    komachi "言いましたよ。扉は暇な人のためのものだって。"

# game/case02.rpy:96
translate japanese case2_9e7de451:

    # marisa "Kirisame Marisa, ordinary magician. Let's keep this quick. I've got reading to do."
    marisa "霧雨魔理沙、普通の魔法使いだ。手短に頼むぜ。読みたい本があるんでな。"

# game/case02.rpy:99
translate japanese case2_17e8d457:

    # eiki "The charge: removal of forty-seven grimoires from the Scarlet Devil library."
    eiki "罪状：紅魔館図書館からの魔導書四十七冊の持ち出し。"

# game/case02.rpy:103
translate japanese case2_674fbfd5:

    # marisa "Removal's a strong word. I prefer \"long-term borrowing.\""
    marisa "持ち出しってのは言い過ぎだ。「長期貸し出し」と呼んでくれ。"

# game/case02.rpy:107
translate japanese case2_ed7ce67f:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Today's defendant won't deny what she did."
    eiki "見習い判事。今日の被告は、自分のしたことを否定しないでしょう。"

# game/case02.rpy:108
translate japanese case2_50d665ef:

    # eiki "So listen for the excuse instead. Excuses love to dress up as reasons."
    eiki "ですから、言い訳に耳を澄ませなさい。言い訳は理由のふりをしたがるものです。"

# game/case02.rpy:124
translate japanese case2_c2ff10c4:

    # marisa_t "I borrowed those books. I'll give 'em back when I die. That's a promise."
    marisa_t "あの本は借りたんだ。死んだら返す。約束だぜ。"

# game/case02.rpy:125
translate japanese case2_e431c5d6:

    # marisa_t "Patchouli hasn't opened most of 'em in a hundred years. I checked the dust."
    marisa_t "パチュリーはその大半を百年は開いてない。埃を確かめたからな。"

# game/case02.rpy:126
translate japanese case2_0174e8b3:

    # marisa_t "And honestly? I'm not the only one around here with sticky fingers."
    marisa_t "それに正直な話、この辺で手癖が悪いのは私だけじゃないぜ。"

# game/case02.rpy:130
translate japanese case2_9a789c8f:

    # eiki "Your witness, Junior Judge. [spirit_Word!t] magatama of spirit, as always."
    eiki "証人をどうぞ、見習い判事。霊力の勾玉はいつも通り[spirit_Word!t]つです。"

# game/case02.rpy:144
translate japanese case2_cross_fde6d5e6:

    # eiki "Again. She'll still be here. Unfortunately."
    eiki "もう一度。彼女はまだここにいます。残念ながら。"

# game/case02.rpy:155
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_a8d47f37:

    # you "Reimu's donation box isn't on trial today. Your forty-seven books are."
    you "今日裁かれているのは霊夢の賽銭箱ではありません。あなたの四十七冊です。"

# game/case02.rpy:156
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_247e476c:

    # you "Even if she's guilty, that doesn't return a single grimoire."
    you "たとえ霊夢が有罪でも、魔導書は一冊も戻ってこない。"

# game/case02.rpy:159
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_0af1229f:

    # marisa "Hey! I was making a comparison! A really convincing one!"
    marisa "おい！比べただけだぜ！すごく説得力のあるやつを！"

# game/case02.rpy:163
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_266a902e:

    # eiki "Tu quoque. \"You too.\""
    eiki "お前だって論法。「あなたもでしょう」。"

# game/case02.rpy:164
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_a8ccd7dc:

    # eiki "Another's wrongdoing does not make yours right. It only makes two."
    eiki "他人の悪事は、あなたの悪事を正しくはしません。悪事が二つになるだけです。"

# game/case02.rpy:165
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_83e8ebfe:

    # eiki "Two thieves do not add up to zero thieves."
    eiki "泥棒が二人いても、泥棒がゼロになるわけではありません。"

# game/case02.rpy:172
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_7170311c:

    # eiki "Defendant Kirisame Marisa. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告人、霧雨魔理沙。当法廷はあなたに……"

# game/case02.rpy:183
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_dc5bf327:

    # eiki "Sentence: return all forty-seven books. Alphabetised. While Patchouli watches."
    eiki "判決：四十七冊すべてを返却すること。五十音順に。パチュリーの監視の下で。"

# game/case02.rpy:186
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_56abae37:

    # marisa "Can I borrow a pen to sign that?"
    marisa "署名用にペン、借りてもいいか？"

# game/case02.rpy:189
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_6063f5e0:

    # eiki "Bailiff."
    eiki "廷吏。"

# game/case02.rpy:190
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "はいよ、四季様。"

# game/case02.rpy:202
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_84d7d5bf:

    # eiki "...Through the window."
    eiki "……窓からですか。"

# game/case02.rpy:203
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_11899929:

    # komachi "She seemed to prefer it."
    komachi "そっちのほうがお好みみたいで。"

# game/case02.rpy:204
translate japanese case2_breakthrough_3d82d9a4:

    # eiki "Court is adjourned."
    eiki "閉廷します。"

translate japanese strings:

    # game/case02.rpy:8
    old "Library Ledger"
    new "図書館の貸出簿"

    # game/case02.rpy:8
    old "Forty-seven grimoires signed out to \"M. Kirisame.\" None returned."
    new "魔導書四十七冊、「M・霧雨」に貸出。返却ゼロ。"

    # game/case02.rpy:10
    old "Shrine Donation Box"
    new "神社の賽銭箱"

    # game/case02.rpy:10
    old "Nearly empty. Contents: one leaf, one button."
    new "ほぼ空っぽ。中身：葉っぱ一枚、ボタン一個。"

    # game/case02.rpy:12
    old "Patchouli's Spare Glasses"
    new "パチュリーの予備の眼鏡"

    # game/case02.rpy:12
    old "Dusty. Found under a stack of unread books."
    new "埃まみれ。未読の本の山の下で発見。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "The Forty-Seven Grimoires"
    new "四十七冊の魔導書"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "I borrowed those books. I'll give 'em back when I die. That's a promise."
    new "あの本は借りたんだ。死んだら返す。約束だぜ。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "A terrible promise is still a promise. Rude, yes. Illogical, no."
    new "ひどい約束でも約束は約束です。失礼ではありますが、非論理的ではありません。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Patchouli hasn't opened most of 'em in a hundred years. I checked the dust."
    new "パチュリーはその大半を百年は開いてない。埃を確かめたからな。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Dust is evidence. Annoyingly good evidence. The bad step is somewhere else."
    new "埃は証拠です。腹立たしいほど良い証拠です。誤った一歩は別の場所にあります。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "And honestly? I'm not the only one around here with sticky fingers."
    new "それに正直な話、この辺で手癖が悪いのは私だけじゃないぜ。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "That's a hint, not an argument. Press her and make her say it."
    new "それはほのめかしで、論証ではありません。揺さぶって、はっきり言わせなさい。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Reimu pockets her own donation box! So who's the real thief here? Not me."
    new "霊夢なんて自分の賽銭箱をくすねてるぜ！本当の泥棒は誰だ？私じゃない。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Close. But she isn't insulting her accuser. She's hiding behind someone else's sins. There's a sharper name for that."
    new "惜しい。ですが彼女は告発者を侮辱してはいません。他人の罪の陰に隠れているのです。もっと的確な名前があります。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Slippery Slope needs a chain of disasters. She predicted nothing. She just pointed at Reimu."
    new "滑り坂論法には災厄の連鎖が必要です。彼女は何も予言していません。霊夢を指さしただけです。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Nobody is mistaking order for cause. She is pointing at Reimu to excuse herself."
    new "順序を原因と取り違えている者はいません。彼女は自分を許すために霊夢を指さしているのです。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "That has nothing to do with the forty-seven books. Show what she actually took."
    new "それは四十七冊の本と何の関係もありません。彼女が実際に持ち出した物を示しなさい。"

